## The read budget

Re-grounding cost is the dominant cost of this workflow. Load at session start:

- Every session: this file (auto-loaded), then specs/STATUS.md, then the active
  spec. Nothing else by default.
- Builder, additionally: only the steering docs the active spec's header names
  as Owner docs.
- Planner, additionally: the DECISIONS.md index table; full ADR entries only on
  demand.
- Everything else is reference material that STATUS.md and the spec point into.
- After a compaction event, and in any multi-hour build, re-read specs/STATUS.md
  and the active spec before continuing.

